  "steps": [
    "Cook the pumpkin (7 minutes in the microwave with a damp paper towel works), then mash.",
    "Mix with the oat flour and salt, adding the flour gradually until you get a mouldable dough.",
    "Roll out between plastic sheets, fill, close using the plastic and press the edges with a fork.",
    "Brush with egg yolk or oil and air-fry at 180 °C for 8 minutes."
